notes[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-07T19:53:45.693Z","harness:codex","Release-readiness boundary: aggregate authored-source coverage is only 77.01/87.31/67.74 after adding the exact-covered lifecycle,not the required 100/100/100. Reachable history contains six identity pairs and host-path matches in 66 of 136 commits,while the current changed-file scan and bounded full-history credential scan found zero credential-pattern matches. pm-915f and pm-vsn5 remain open; no npm publication is authorized."
  "2026-08-07T19:53:45.693Z","harness:codex","text=Local verification before review: npm ci executed the production prepare hook; npm run release:check passed typecheck,59 tests,configured all-source coverage,production audit with zero vulnerabilities,pack dry-run,and deterministic changelog; bun run release:check passed the same gate. scripts/prepare-merge-driver.ts measured exact 100/100/100. Fresh packed-artifact acceptance against installed pm 2026.8.7 listed seven presets,showed/diffed/validated agent-workflow,applied it,created a real AgentRun item,and passed pm validate."
